#: ../../source/ascii-video_README.md:32
msgid "**Input** loads source material (or nothing for generative)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/ascii-video_README.md:33
msgid ""
"**Analyze** extracts per-frame features. Audio gets 6-band FFT, RMS, "
"spectral centroid, flatness, flux, beat detection with exponential decay."
" Video gets luminance, edges, motion."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/ascii-video_README.md:34
msgid ""
"**Scene function** returns a pixel canvas directly. Composes multiple "
"character grids at different densities, value/hue fields, pixel blend "
"modes. This is where the visuals happen."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/ascii-video_README.md:35
msgid ""
"**Tonemap** does adaptive percentile-based brightness normalization with "
"per-scene gamma. ASCII on black is inherently dark. Linear multipliers "
"don't work. This does."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/ascii-video_README.md:36
msgid ""
"**Shade** runs a `ShaderChain` (38 composable shaders) plus a "
"`FeedbackBuffer` for temporal recursion with spatial transforms."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/ascii-video_README.md:37
msgid ""
"**Encode** pipes raw RGB frames to ffmpeg for H.264 encoding. Segments "
"concatenated, audio muxed."
msgstr ""

