#: ../../source/ascii-video_README.md:202
msgid ""
"20 pixel blend modes for layering canvases: normal, add, subtract, "
"multiply, screen, overlay, softlight, hardlight, difference, exclusion, "
"colordodge, colorburn, linearlight, vividlight, pin_light, hard_mix, "
"lighten, darken, grain_extract, grain_merge. Both sRGB and linear-light "
"blending supported."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/ascii-video_README.md:204
msgid ""
"**Feedback buffer.** Temporal recursion — each frame blends with a "
"transformed version of the previous frame. 7 spatial transforms: zoom, "
"shrink, rotate CW/CCW, shift up/down, mirror. Optional per-frame hue "
"shift for rainbow trails. Configurable decay, blend mode, and opacity per"
" scene."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/ascii-video_README.md:206
msgid ""
"**Masking.** 16 mask types for spatial compositing: shape masks (circle, "
"rect, ring, gradients), procedural masks (any value field as a mask, text"
" stencils), animated masks (iris open/close, wipe, dissolve), boolean "
"operations (union, intersection, subtraction, invert)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/ascii-video_README.md:208
msgid ""
"**Transitions.** Crossfade, directional wipe, radial wipe, dissolve, "
"glitch cut."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/ascii-video_README.md:210
msgid "Scene design patterns"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/ascii-video_README.md:212
msgid ""
"Compositional patterns for making scenes that look intentional rather "
"than random."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/ascii-video_README.md:214
msgid ""
"**Layer hierarchy.** Background (dim atmosphere, dense grid), content "
"(main visual, standard grid), accent (sparse highlights, coarse grid). "
"Three distinct roles, not three competing layers."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/ascii-video_README.md:216
msgid ""
"**Directional parameter arcs.** The defining parameter of each scene "
"ramps, accelerates, or builds over its duration. Progress-based formulas "
"(linear, ease-out, step reveal) replace aimless `sin(t)` oscillation."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/ascii-video_README.md:218
msgid ""
"**Scene concepts.** Scenes built around visual metaphors (emergence, "
"descent, collision, entropy) with motivated layer/palette/feedback "
"choices. Not named after their effects."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/ascii-video_README.md:220
msgid ""
"**Compositional techniques.** Counter-rotating dual systems, wave "
"collision, progressive fragmentation (voronoi cells multiplying over "
"time), entropy (geometry consumed by reaction-diffusion), staggered layer"
" entry (crescendo buildup)."
msgstr ""

